// A listener reopens a renamed log before the next worker.
// The open file is not cut. Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE sync ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG sync law

IMPULSE sync 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "sync" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
